From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hardened NanoKVM kernel port <noreply@local>
Date: Sun, 23 Aug 2026 22:38:04 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 2/9] module: restore stable validation and address masking

Keep both upstream SD discard and vendor long-read quirks on distinct bits. Restore stable module signature/ELF validation, vermagic enforcement and /proc/modules address masking; the recovery build rebuilds every retained module against the candidate kernel.
